date-released: 2026-10-18
type: article
title: "Quantitative robust estimation for Gaussian inverse problems"
authors:
  - name: Anonymous
version: 1.0.0-candidate
license: CC0-1.0
abstract: >-
  A uniform finite-dimensional additive regret theorem for a spectral robust
  linear estimator, with a population anisotropic-jitter implementation when
  the minimizing dual parameter is positive and an isotropic boundary under
  positive-noise active-estimation hypotheses.
keywords:
  - inverse problems
  - robust estimation
  - Gaussian models
  - spectral estimators
